Chapter: WorldIndex

 Runtime-only side arrays use slot+1 links (zero is absent). The direct
 768x512 block directory selects a recycled64-tile page. Page storage is
 reserved at construction, so receive-arena restoration cannot free it.

 A page directory is two levels: a top of wi-top-entries pointers, each to a block of 256 page pointers made when its
 first page is set, so 2^24 slots take a 2 KiB top and a table pays only for the blocks its pages use.
  wi-top-entries : Integer = 256
  wi-dir-at : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-dir-at (top) (page) = peek-qword (peek-qword top (bit-shr page 8 * 8)) (bit-and page 255 * 8)
  wi-dir-get : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-dir-get (top) (page) = if page < 0 | page >= wi-top-entries * 256 then 0
    else let block = peek-qword top (bit-shr page 8 * 8) in if block == 0 then 0 else peek-qword block (bit-and page 255 * 8)
  wi-dir-set : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-dir-set (top) (page) (value) = let at = bit-shr page 8 * 8
    in let block = if peek-qword top at /= 0 then peek-qword top at
      else let made = alloc-bytes 2048 in let cleared = wi-zero made 2048 0 in let set = poke-qword top at made in made
    in poke-qword block (bit-and page 255 * 8) value
  wi-dir-blocks : Integer -> Integer
  wi-dir-blocks (pages) = (pages + 255) / 256
  wi-object : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-object (buffer) (slot) = wi-dir-at (buffer + 16) (bit-shr slot 8) + bit-and slot 255 * 80
 A serial's low 30 bits are slot + 1 + generation * 2^24 (root for Damian, 2026-10-08): 2^24 slots, 64 generations a
 slot, so 2^30 serials over a world's life. A slot whose next generation would pass 2^30 is retired, never reused.
  wi-slot-space : Integer = 16777216
  wi-serial-mask : Integer = 1073741823
  wi-low-slot : Integer -> Integer
  wi-low-slot (low) = int-mod (low - 1) wi-slot-space
 The low serial a slot issues next, from its row's serial cell (0 for never used, minus the last serial when free).
  wi-next-low : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-next-low (old) (slot) = if old == 0 then slot + 1 else bit-and (0 - old) wi-serial-mask + wi-slot-space
  wi-retired : Integer, Integer -> Boolean
  wi-retired (old) (slot) = old < 0 & wi-next-low old slot > wi-serial-mask
 The index block holds a 128-byte header, the 768x512 block directory (u32 tile-page tags), then three directory tops:
 pages of 256 slot rows (72 bytes each), pages of 256 tile pages (304 bytes each), and pages of 256 announce cells
 (8 bytes each). The world holds at most wi-pages * 256 objects, the serial scheme's 2^24 slots.
  wi-pages : Integer = 65536
  wi-rows-at : Integer = 128 + 1572864
  wi-tiles-at : Integer = wi-rows-at + wi-top-entries * 8
  wi-said-at : Integer = wi-tiles-at + wi-top-entries * 8
  wi-block-bytes : Integer -> Integer
  wi-block-bytes (capacity) = wi-said-at + wi-top-entries * 8
  wi-row : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-row (index) (slot) = wi-dir-at (index + wi-rows-at) (bit-shr slot 8) + bit-and slot 255 * 72
  wi-said : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-said (index) (slot) = wi-dir-at (index + wi-said-at) (bit-shr slot 8) + bit-and slot 255 * 8
  wi-directory : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-directory (index) (capacity) = index + 128
  wi-page : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-page (index) (capacity) (tag) = wi-dir-at (index + wi-tiles-at) (bit-shr (tag - 1) 8) + bit-and (tag - 1) 255 * 304
  wi-bytes : Integer -> Integer
  wi-bytes (capacity) = wi-block-bytes capacity + (capacity + 255) / 256 * 98304 + 3 * wi-dir-blocks ((capacity + 255) / 256) * 2048
  wi-add-pages : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-add-pages (index) (page) (pages) = if page >= pages then 0
    else let rows = alloc-bytes 18432
    in let a = wi-zero rows 18432 0
    in let b = wi-dir-set (index + wi-rows-at) page rows
    in let tiles = alloc-bytes 77824
    in let c = wi-zero tiles 77824 0
    in let d = wi-dir-set (index + wi-tiles-at) page tiles
    in let said = alloc-bytes 2048
    in let e = wi-zero said 2048 0
    in let f = wi-dir-set (index + wi-said-at) page said
    in wi-add-pages index (page + 1) pages
  wi-zero : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-zero (buf) (size) (i) = if i >= size then 0 else let cleared = poke-qword buf i 0 in wi-zero buf size (i + 8)
  wi-free-pages : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-free-pages (index) (capacity) (i) = if i == capacity then 0
    else let next = poke-qword (wi-page index capacity (i + 1)) 32 (if i + 1 == capacity then 0 else i + 2)
    in wi-free-pages index capacity (i + 1)
 Tags capacity + 1 .. stop join the tile-page free list ahead of head (0 is none).
  wi-grow-tags : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-grow-tags (index) (capacity) (stop) (head) = if capacity >= stop then 0
    else let next = poke-qword (wi-page index stop (capacity + 1)) 32 (if capacity + 1 == stop then head else capacity + 2)
    in wi-grow-tags index (capacity + 1) stop head
  wi-new : Integer -> Integer
  wi-new (capacity) = let index = alloc-bytes (wi-block-bytes capacity)
    in let clear = wi-zero index (wi-block-bytes capacity) 0

    in let paged = wi-add-pages index 0 ((capacity + 255) / 256)
    in let pages = wi-free-pages index capacity 0
    in let free = poke-qword index 8 1
    in let cap = poke-qword index 24 capacity
    in let ready = poke-qword index 32 1
    in index
  wi-slot : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-slot (buffer) (capacity) (serial) = if serial <= 0 | serial > 2147483647 then -1
    else let low = bit-and serial wi-serial-mask
    in if low == 0 then -1 else let slot = wi-low-slot low
    in if slot >= capacity then -1 else if peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 0 == serial then slot else -1
  wi-serial : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-serial (buffer) (tag) = if tag <= 0 then 0 else peek-qword (wi-object buffer (tag - 1)) 0
  wi-layer : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-layer (buffer) (index) (slot) = let row = wi-row index slot
    in if peek-qword row 48 == peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 0 then peek-qword row 40 else 0
  wi-child-layer : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-child-layer (buffer) (index) (tag) (layer) (best) = if tag == 0 then best
    else let slot = tag - 1
    in let next = peek-qword (wi-row index slot) 16
    in wi-child-layer buffer index next layer (if wi-layer buffer index slot == layer & (best == 0 | tag < best) then tag else best)
  wi-set-layer : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-set-layer (buffer) (capacity) (index) (slot) (layer) = let row = wi-row index slot
    in let name = poke-qword row 48 (peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 0)
    in let changed = poke-qword row 40 layer in 0
  wi-raise : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-raise (buffer) (capacity) (index) (parent) (height) (left) = if parent == 0 then 0
    else if left <= 0 then -1
    else let slot = wi-slot buffer capacity parent
    in if slot < 0 then -1 else let row = wi-row index slot
    in if peek-qword row 32 >= height then 0
    else let raised = poke-qword row 32 height
    in wi-raise buffer capacity index (peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 56) (height + 1) (left - 1)
  wi-maximum : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-maximum (index) (tag) (best) = if tag == 0 then best
    else let row = wi-row index (tag - 1)
    in wi-maximum index (peek-qword row 16) (max best (peek-qword row 32 + 1))
  wi-refresh : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-refresh (buffer) (capacity) (index) (parent) (left) = if parent == 0 | left <= 0 then 0
    else let slot = wi-slot buffer capacity parent
    in if slot < 0 then 0 else let row = wi-row index slot
    in let height = wi-maximum index (peek-qword row 8) 0
    in if height == peek-qword row 32 then 0
    else let changed = poke-qword row 32 height
    in wi-refresh buffer capacity index (peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 56) (left - 1)
  wi-child-add : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Boolean -> Integer
  wi-child-add (buffer) (capacity) (index) (slot) (heights) = let serial = peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 56
    in if serial == 0 then wi-root-add index slot else let parent = wi-slot buffer capacity serial
    in if parent < 0 then -1 else let row = wi-row index parent
    in let child = wi-row index slot
    in let head = peek-qword row 8
    in let next = poke-qword child 16 head
    in let prev = poke-qword child 24 0
    in let linked = if head == 0 then 0 else poke-qword (wi-row index (head - 1)) 24 (slot + 1)
    in let first = poke-qword row 8 (slot + 1)
    in let count = poke-qword row 0 (peek-qword row 0 + 1)
    in if heights then wi-raise buffer capacity index serial (peek-qword child 32 + 1) 64 else 0
  wi-child-remove : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-child-remove (buffer) (capacity) (index) (slot) = let serial = peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 56
    in if serial == 0 then wi-root-remove index slot else let parent = wi-slot buffer capacity serial
    in if parent < 0 then -1 else let row = wi-row index parent
    in let child = wi-row index slot
    in let next = peek-qword child 16
    in let prev = peek-qword child 24
    in let first = if prev == 0 then poke-qword row 8 next else poke-qword (wi-row index (prev - 1)) 16 next
    in let linked = if next == 0 then 0 else poke-qword (wi-row index (next - 1)) 24 prev
    in let count = poke-qword row 0 (peek-qword row 0 - 1)
    in let clear-next = poke-qword child 16 0
    in let clear-prev = poke-qword child 24 0
    in if peek-qword child 32 + 1 < peek-qword row 32 then 0
    else if peek-qword child 32 == 0 & peek-qword row 32 == 1 & peek-qword row 0 > 0 then 0
    else wi-refresh buffer capacity index serial 64
  wi-root-add : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-root-add (index) (slot) = let row = wi-row index slot
    in let head = peek-qword index 56
    in let next = poke-qword row 16 head
    in let prev = poke-qword row 24 0
    in let linked = if head == 0 then 0 else poke-qword (wi-row index (head - 1)) 24 (slot + 1)
    in let first = poke-qword index 56 (slot + 1)
    in poke-qword index 48 (peek-qword index 48 + 1)
  wi-root-remove : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-root-remove (index) (slot) = let row = wi-row index slot
    in let next = peek-qword row 16
    in let prev = peek-qword row 24
    in let first = if prev == 0 then poke-qword index 56 next else poke-qword (wi-row index (prev - 1)) 16 next
    in let linked = if next == 0 then 0 else poke-qword (wi-row index (next - 1)) 24 prev
    in let a = poke-qword row 16 0
    in let b = poke-qword row 24 0
    in poke-qword index 48 (peek-qword index 48 - 1)
  wi-page-get : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-page-get (index) (capacity) (block) = let directory = wi-directory index capacity
    in let found = peek-32 directory (block * 4)
    in if found > 0 then found else let tag = peek-qword index 8
    in if tag == 0 then 0 else let page = wi-page index capacity tag
    in let free = poke-qword index 8 (peek-qword page 32)
    in let first = peek-qword index 16
    in let a = poke-qword page 0 block
    in let b = poke-qword page 8 0
    in let c = poke-qword page 16 first
    in let d = poke-qword page 24 0
    in let e = if first == 0 then 0 else poke-qword (wi-page index capacity first) 24 tag
    in let active = poke-qword index 16 tag
    in let mapped = poke-32 directory (block * 4) tag
    in tag
  wi-page-free : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-page-free (index) (capacity) (tag) = let page = wi-page index capacity tag
    in let next = peek-qword page 16
    in let prev = peek-qword page 24
    in let first = if prev == 0 then poke-qword index 16 next else poke-qword (wi-page index capacity prev) 16 next
    in let linked = if next == 0 then 0 else poke-qword (wi-page index capacity next) 24 prev
    in let cleared = poke-32 (wi-directory index capacity) (peek-qword page 0 * 4) 0
    in let free = poke-qword page 32 (peek-qword index 8)
    in poke-qword index 8 tag
  wi-tile-add : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-tile-add (buffer) (capacity) (index) (slot) = if peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 56 /= 0 then 0
    else let x = peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 16
    in let y = peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 24
    in let block = x / 8 * 512 + y / 8
    in let tag = wi-page-get index capacity block
    in if tag == 0 then -1 else let page = wi-page index capacity tag
    in let at = 48 + (int-mod y 8 * 8 + int-mod x 8) * 4
    in let head = peek-32 page at
    in let row = wi-row index slot
    in let a = poke-qword row 56 head
    in let b = poke-qword row 64 0
    in let c = if head == 0 then 0 else poke-qword (wi-row index (head - 1)) 64 (slot + 1)
    in let d = poke-32 page at (slot + 1)
    in poke-qword page 8 (peek-qword page 8 + 1)
  wi-tile-remove : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-tile-remove (buffer) (capacity) (index) (slot) = if peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 56 /= 0 then 0
    else let x = peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 16
    in let y = peek-qword (wi-object buffer slot) 24
    in let tag = peek-32 (wi-directory index capacity) ((x / 8 * 512 + y / 8) * 4)
    in if tag == 0 then -1 else let page = wi-page index capacity tag
    in let at = 48 + (int-mod y 8 * 8 + int-mod x 8) * 4
    in let row = wi-row index slot
    in let next = peek-qword row 56
    in let prev = peek-qword row 64
    in let a = if prev == 0 then poke-32 page at next else poke-qword (wi-row index (prev - 1)) 56 next
    in let b = if next == 0 then 0 else poke-qword (wi-row index (next - 1)) 64 prev
    in let c = poke-qword row 56 0
    in let d = poke-qword row 64 0
    in let count = poke-qword page 8 (peek-qword page 8 - 1)
    in if peek-qword page 8 == 0 then wi-page-free index capacity tag else 0
  wi-tile-head : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-tile-head (index) (capacity) (x) (y) = if x < 0 | x >= 6144 | y < 0 | y >= 4096 then 0
    else let tag = peek-32 (wi-directory index capacity) ((x / 8 * 512 + y / 8) * 4)
    in if tag == 0 then 0 else peek-32 (wi-page index capacity tag) (48 + (int-mod y 8 * 8 + int-mod x 8) * 4)
  wi-clear-pages : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-clear-pages (index) (capacity) = let tag = peek-qword index 16
    in if tag == 0 then 0 else let page = wi-page index capacity tag
    in let clear = wi-zero (page + 48) 256 0
    in let count = poke-qword page 8 0
    in let freed = wi-page-free index capacity tag
    in wi-clear-pages index capacity
  wi-clear-rows : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  wi-clear-rows (index) (capacity) (i) = if i == capacity then 0
    else let row = wi-row index i
    in let a = wi-zero row 40 0
    in let b = wi-zero (row + 56) 16 0
    in wi-clear-rows index capacity (i + 1)
  wi-build-rows : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Boolean
  wi-build-rows (buffer) (capacity) (index) (i) = if i == capacity then True
    else if peek-qword (wi-object buffer i) 0 <= 0 then wi-build-rows buffer capacity index (i + 1)
    else if wi-child-add buffer capacity index i False < 0 then False
    else if wi-tile-add buffer capacity index i < 0 then False
    else wi-build-rows buffer capacity index (i + 1)
  wi-build-heights : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Boolean
  wi-build-heights (buffer) (capacity) (index) (i) = if i == capacity then True
    else if peek-qword (wi-object buffer i) 0 <= 0 then wi-build-heights buffer capacity index (i + 1)
    else if wi-raise buffer capacity index (peek-qword (wi-object buffer i) 56) 1 64 < 0 then False
    else wi-build-heights buffer capacity index (i + 1)
  wi-rebuild : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Boolean
  wi-rebuild (buffer) (capacity) (index) = let pending = poke-qword index 32 0
    in let pages = wi-clear-pages index capacity
    in let rows = wi-clear-rows index capacity 0
    in let root-count = poke-qword index 48 0
    in let root-head = poke-qword index 56 0
    in if not (wi-build-rows buffer capacity index 0 & wi-build-heights buffer capacity index 0) then False
    else let ready = poke-qword index 32 1 in True
